
* extra reading main menu, for eample std_help.rc
  (but 3rd does not...)

* Build portable binaries

  debian standard terminfo search path:
	/etc/terminfo:/lib/terminfo:/usr/share/terminfo
  fedora standard terminfo search path:
	/etc/terminfo:/usr/share/terminfo
  so, default environment in debian for static binaries built under fedora
  is wrong (but is perfect otherwise!!)
